    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1sampleprof_1_1_profile_symbol_list" kindref="compound">ProfileSymbolList</ref> records the list of function symbols shown up in the binary used to generate the profile. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It is useful to to discriminate a function being so cold as not to shown up in the profile and a function newly added. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
